DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The rreeaallppaatthh utility uses realpath(3) to resolve all symbolic links, ex‐
     tra “/” characters and references to _/_._/ and _/_._._/ in _f_i_l_e, and prints the
     absolute pathname on standard output.

     The options are as follows:

     --qq      Do not print errors.

